# App Store Ready Screenshots

All screenshots in this folder are **1242 × 2688px** - ready for App Store Connect upload.

## Files

Screenshots will appear here after running the resize command from the parent directory.

## Upload to App Store

1. Select all PNG files from this folder
2. Go to App Store Connect
3. Navigate to: App Store → iOS Screenshots → 6.7" Display
4. Drag and drop files or click to upload
5. Arrange in desired order
6. Save changes

These screenshots are optimized for:
- iPhone 14 Pro Max
- iPhone 15 Pro Max
- iPhone 15 Plus
- iPhone 14 Plus
